WEBVTT

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:04.529
they got the call and responded
to the World Trade Center.

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:07.126
And they went up the stairs,

00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:09.136
and none of them ever came back.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:12.296
Now, I don't know if they had known
what was going to happen

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:14.208
whether they would have done it or not.

00:05:14.232 --> 00:05:15.466
That's all speculative.

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:18.976
But what I do know is they stepped forward

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.727
into their destiny.

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:26.278
I think the climate crisis

00:05:26.302 --> 00:05:29.146
has some things in common
with that moment.

00:05:29.579 --> 00:05:31.962
None of us would have asked
for the climate crisis